<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:gl="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Shaders;assembly=Bonsai.Shaders"
                 xmlns:aud="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Audio;assembly=OpenRigs.Audio"
                 xmlns:trl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Trials;assembly=OpenRigs.Trials"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>The penalty flash, the same in every task with a projector: give it each trial's outcome (an OpenRigs.Trials TrialOutcome, as TrialOutcomeEffects passes it on); each one whose PenaltyFlash plays (penalised, its kind's penalty.&lt;kind&gt;.flash.brightness above 0) flashes the whole projector field at that brightness of full white (drawn on DrawStimuli over everything else, Layer 400, then mesh mapped and gamma corrected by ProjectorDisplay, so 1 is the projector's full white), on for the first half of each 1/rateHz cycle and the normal display the other half, from the first frame after the outcome for the penalty sound's length, all on the render clock (Bonsai.Shaders Timer and Delay). At Go (TrialRules) it checks the task's flashes (TrialRules' PenaltyFlashes, OpenRigs.Trials PenaltyFlashRules: brightness 0 to 1, rateHz above 0 and at most 30 Hz, half the 60 Hz render loop) and that the penalty sound (OpenRigs.Audio PenaltySoundSeconds, read at Start) fits in the shortest timeout with a flash, stopping the workflow naming every problem (CheckPenaltyFlashes) into the AsyncSubject PenaltyFlashDuration. Each outcome is passed on. Needs TrialRules (with PenaltyFlashes), Speakers and DrawStimuli (ProjectorDisplay) from the workflow.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>TrialRules</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
        <Selector>PenaltyFlashes</Selector>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>Speakers</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="aud:PenaltySoundSeconds" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="trl:CheckPenaltyFlashes" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
          <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
        <Name>PenaltyFlashDuration</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
        <Name>Source1</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>Flashes?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>PenaltyFlash.Plays</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
        <Selector>PenaltyFlash</Selector>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>PenaltyFlashDuration</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
        <Name>Flash</Name>
        <Description>One flash, given (the PenaltyFlash, its length): every frame on DrawStimuli from the first after the outcome until the length has passed (End), the whole field drawn at Brightness on each cycle's on half (Onsets every Period, Offsets OnTime after each), all on the render clock.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="Period" Selector="Item1.Period" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>Onsets</Name>
              <Combinator xsi:type="gl:Timer">
                <gl:DueTime>PT0S</gl:DueTime>
                <gl:Period>PT0.1S</gl:Period>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
                <Value>true</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="DueTime" Selector="Item1.OnTime" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>Offsets</Name>
              <Combinator xsi:type="gl:Delay">
                <gl:DueTime>PT0.05S</gl:DueTime>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
                <Value>false</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>DrawStimuli</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>On?</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Item2</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Item1</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="ColorR" Selector="Item1.Brightness" />
                <Property Name="ColorG" Selector="Item1.Brightness" />
                <Property Name="ColorB" Selector="Item1.Brightness" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="BonVision:Primitives.DrawQuad.bonsai">
              <ExtentX>360</ExtentX>
              <ExtentY>180</ExtentY>
              <LocationX>0</LocationX>
              <LocationY>30</LocationY>
              <Layer>400</Layer>
              <Angle>0</Angle>
              <ColorR>0</ColorR>
              <ColorG>0</ColorG>
              <ColorB>0</ColorB>
              <ColorA>1</ColorA>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="DueTime" Selector="Item2" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>End</Name>
              <Combinator xsi:type="gl:Timer">
                <gl:DueTime>PT1S</gl:DueTime>
                <gl:Period>PT0S</gl:Period>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:TakeUntil" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="9" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="0" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="4" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="10" To="12" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="8" To="14" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
